    (r"ដោះស្រាយវិសមីការ $\cos x \ge \dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$ ៖", r"$-\dfrac{\pi}{6} + 2k\pi \le x \le \dfrac{\pi}{6} + 2k\pi$", [r"$\dfrac{\pi}{6} + 2k\pi \le x \le \dfrac{11\pi}{6} + 2k\pi$", r"$x \le \dfrac{\pi}{6}$", r"$-\dfrac{\pi}{3} + 2k\pi \le x \le \dfrac{\pi}{3} + 2k\pi$"], r"$\cos x \ge a$ ៖ $-\alpha + 2k\pi \le x \le \alpha + 2k\pi$ ។"),
